[
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Permafrost, high winds, and blizzards...",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "It seems strange and... unsettling.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Do you have any ideas on how to explore this place?",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "It's dangerous here.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "I'll take you to a safe place.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "Great! Perhaps I can help too. Allow me to map this area in return.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 7,
    "DialogueContent": "Also, I marked some other spirits that I detected.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Amazing! Your coffin...it’s very special! It allows me to see your surroundings.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Ever since I entered here, I have felt my strength slowly growing.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Through this coffin, I may even help you more with the map!",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "Could you find some items to enhance my strengths?",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "This one <sprite index=0> ?",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "Oh, of course, let me see... 500 <sprite index=0> should be enough.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 1,
    "SpiritState": 3,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Remember to take a break every now and then.",
    "SpeakerID": 1,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "It's you! I thought that Samurai killed you!",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Hurry! Take me somewhere safe.",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Even though your coffin is broken, you still need to protect me!",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "I have to dodge these monsters' attacks constantly.",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "...Okay.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Hmm, not bad—this is much more comfortable than your coffin.",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "What was it like in the coffin?",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Oh, it was much more crowded in there—felt like a packed prison.",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "I didn't know that before...It can’t be...",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "Never mind. Now that I've finally found a safe place, I will rest.",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 2,
    "SpiritState": 3,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "What are you staring at? Never seen a champion prepare before?",
    "SpeakerID": 2,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Oh, you've finally come to fetch me again!",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Would you like to see my juggling act?",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "I hope this will help you get over your previous failure!",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "That was just bad luck! It won’t happen again!",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "I can teach you to throw your scythe, too!",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "That's enough! It's time to go.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "So did the new skill help?",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Yes.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Great, I'm glad I could help!",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "If only I could have helped you in that battle!",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "Let's not talk about it anymore.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 3,
    "SpiritState": 3,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Miss my show?",
    "SpeakerID": 3,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "You're back. Are you feeling better?",
    "SpeakerID": 4,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Nothing wrong... just need a bit more rest.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "I see. You should be able to find this herb(<sprite index=1>) somewhere.",
    "SpeakerID": 4,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "Bring me three, and I'll help restore your strength.",
    "SpeakerID": 4,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "Here's the last bit I have left; try it.",
    "SpeakerID": 4,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 4,
    "SpiritState": 3,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Feeling better?",
    "SpeakerID": 4,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Glory! Death! Slaughter!",
    "SpeakerID": 5,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Well, look who I've found—the loser of the duel.",
    "SpeakerID": 5,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "You seem weaker than before.",
    "SpeakerID": 5,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "I'm not weak—I just need more time.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "Ha! That's something I can easily help with.",
    "SpeakerID": 5,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 6,
    "DialogueContent": "Take me to your place, and I'll teach you some new techniques.",
    "SpeakerID": 5,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "This is a good spot for training.",
    "SpeakerID": 5,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Your previous attacks are too simple.",
    "SpeakerID": 5,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "What should I do?",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "Bring me some <sprite index=0> .",
    "SpeakerID": 5,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 1,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "I'll show you how to wield your scythe more effectively.",
    "SpeakerID": 5,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 5,
    "SpiritState": 3,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Don't let up!",
    "SpeakerID": 5,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 6,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Is this what they call the afterlife?!",
    "SpeakerID": 6,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 6,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "No. This is the Drift—the space between life and death.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 6,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Then, does that mean you're... the Grim Reaper?",
    "SpeakerID": 6,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 6,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "Yes. My purpose is to guide you to the afterlife.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 6,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 5,
    "DialogueContent": "Then be quick! I feel strange here!",
    "SpeakerID": 6,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 7,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "Ahhhhh! Why did I end up in this hellhole after I died?! ",
    "SpeakerID": 7,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 7,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "Calm yourself.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 7,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Monsters! They're everywhere! I need to find a safe place!",
    "SpeakerID": 7,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 7,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 4,
    "DialogueContent": "My coffin will protect you from the monsters.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 8,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 1,
    "DialogueContent": "A scythe! A skeleton! You're one of them!",
    "SpeakerID": 8,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 8,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 2,
    "DialogueContent": "No. My duty is to escort you to the afterlife.",
    "SpeakerID": 0,
    "Column5": ""
  },
  {
    "SpiritID": 8,
    "SpiritState": 0,
    "LineID": 3,
    "DialogueContent": "Then do your job!",
    "SpeakerID": 8,
    "Column5": ""
  }
]